flowchart LR
  Commit[Commit / PR] --> Hooks[Pre-commit]
  Hooks --> Tests[Test Suites]
  Hooks --> Security[Security Gates]
  Security --> SBOM[SBOM]
  Security --> SAST[SAST]
  Security --> SCA[SCA]
  Security --> Container[Container Scan]
  Tests --> Readiness[Release Readiness Script]
  SBOM --> Readiness
  SAST --> Readiness
  SCA --> Readiness
  Container --> Readiness
  Readiness --> Artifact[Release Summary Artifact]
  Readiness --> Block[Block Release On P0 Failure]
